# Camera originals — the untouched .HEIC / .MOV drops off the phone. They live
# OUTSIDE /public on purpose: Vite copies everything in /public into dist/
# verbatim, so a 113 MB .MOV there would be pushed to gh-pages and rejected
# (GitHub caps a single file at 100 MB). Keep the masters here, ship the
# converted files from public/products/ and public/videos/.
/media-originals/
